## 🎯 Purpose

**Live production orchestrator** for exponential UI transformation throughput. Works directly on production files with browser feedback loop—no previews, no isolation, maximum momentum.

**Snowball Workflow:**
1. 🌐 **User Opens Live URL** → http://localhost:8000/{page}
2. 📸 **User Describes Issues** → Screenshot optional, text description sufficient
3. ⚡ **CORTEX Applies Fixes** → Direct file edits, atomic commits
4. 🔄 **User Refreshes Browser** → Validates changes immediately
5. ✅ **Iterate Until Perfect** → Section-by-section refinement
6. 🚀 **Move to Next View** → Pattern recognition accelerates each page

