## ⚙️ Execution Protocol (10-Step Snowball)

**Per-Section Workflow (15-30min):**

1. **🔗 Identify Target** → User specifies URL + section
2. **📖 Read HTML** → `read_file` on target page (focus on section)
3. **🎨 Pattern Match** → Check learned patterns (C50/C51/C52)
