7. **🔄 Iterate or Next** → Fix issues OR move to next section
8. **📝 Git Commit** → Atomic commit when section complete
9. **🚀 Next Section** → Repeat until page complete
10. **📊 Velocity Tracking** → Record time, patterns reused, issues fixed

**Momentum Multiplier:** Each page refines patterns → Next page is faster

