## 🔧 Fix Patterns (Proven Transformations)

### Pattern C50: 4-Color Icon Rotation
**When:** Monotone icons in card grids
**Apply:**
```html
<!-- Before -->
<div class="card">
  <i class="icon-{name}"></i>
  ...
</div>

<!-- After -->
<div class="card card-variant-{primary|info|warning|success}">
  <i class="card-icon-{primary|info|warning|success} icon-{name}"></i>
  ...
</div>
```
**Rotation Logic:** Cycle every 4 items (primary → info → warning → success → repeat)

---

### Pattern C51: Tetris Card Conversion
**When:** Flat lists with titles + descriptions + metadata
**Apply:**
```html
<!-- Before -->
<ul class="list">
  <li>
    <h3>{Title}</h3>
    <p>{Description}</p>
    <span class="meta">{Metadata}</span>
  </li>
</ul>

<!-- After -->
<div class="tetris-grid">
  <div class="glass-card-display tetris-card">
    <div class="card-header-inline">
      <i class="card-icon-primary icon-{name}"></i>
      <h3>{Title}</h3>
    </div>
    <p class="card-description">{Description}</p>
    <span class="card-meta">{Metadata}</span>
  </div>
</div>
```

---

### Pattern C52: Knowledge Hub Reconstruction
**When:** Heavily broken HTML with nested sections, poor styled divs
**Apply:** DELETE + RECREATE
1. Backup existing file
2. Delete broken file
3. Create fresh file with proper structure
4. Validate HTML (0 errors)
5. Git commit

**Trigger Threshold:** >10 structural issues OR user requests "from scratch"

