### 2. Quick Issue Scan (UI-Focused Only)

**Detection Time:** <30 seconds vs 5min for full matrix

| Category | Common Issues | Fix Pattern |
|----------|---------------|-------------|
| 🎨 **Design** | Monotone icons, poor styled divs, missing hover, icon-title vertical | C50/C51 patterns |
| 🔒 **Correctness** | Missing ARIA, contrast <4.5:1, touch <44px, inline styles | Semantic HTML + CSS classes |
| ⚡ **Performance** | Large images >500KB, no lazy load, blocking scripts, large DOM >1500 | Optimize + lazy loading |
| 🏗️ **Structure** | Nested sections, duplicate IDs, broken links, missing alt | Fix closure + uniqueness |

**Skip:** Observability, logging, metrics (not UI-relevant)

